OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mainly dry day with some
OL,6,Fbright spells, but the cloud may
OL,7,Fthicken enough to bring the odd spot
OL,8,Fof rain in the afternoon. Winds will
OL,9,Ffreshen from the south or southeast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FAny spots of rain clearing
OL,12,Fthis evening and the rest of the night
OL,13,Fwill be dry, with some clear
OL,14,Fintervals. Quite breezy.
OL,15,
OL,16,CWednesday:FIt will be a bright and
OL,17,Fmainly dry day with the cloud thinning
OL,18,Fat times to allow some bright or sunny
OL,19,Fintervals, though a few showers are
OL,20,Fpossible. Warmer.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
